          "subtitle": "Vying",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Call of Cthulhu The Card Game is a commercial card game of story contests and horror-themed faction decks."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Published by Fantasy Flight Games, Call of Cthulhu The Card Game adapts the Cthulhu Mythos into a constructed-deck contest over story cards."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
