              "text": "2 players use the table arrangement described for Call of Cthulhu The Card Game."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Constructed Call of Cthulhu card game decks"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Constructed Call of Cthulhu card game decks, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
